Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Where did all these monsters come from?",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Hold your ground, everyone!
We are the only ones who can protect Hyrule!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "We have to protect the princess!
Link, hurry!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Fight for Hyrule!
Protect Princess Zelda with your life!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "This lizard's too strong!
How do you kill it?!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "The lizard is our first priority!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Come at me!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Is he really just a new recruit...?",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Who is this soldier, anyway?",
  "1.0.9.0" => "If you're ready to join your ancestors,
I accept your challenge!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Don't let the dragon knight through!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "Urgh... I don't know who you are,
but today settles nothing.",
  "1.0.12.0" => "We can't get to Princess Zelda with those
boulders in the way!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "We can't hold them anymore!
Somebody, help!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Oh no! Let's go help them, Link!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "There, that'll stop them from getting through!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Thanks a ton! Hey, you should take the
treasure in that mine as a reward!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Our treasure...
I'll just leave it here...",
  "1.0.18.0" => "With those bombs, we should be able to break
the boulders and proceed to Princess Zelda!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Attack! Destroy! Massacre! Kill this so-
called princess before I grow impatient!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Capture both the Central and East Field Keeps,
and close the gates!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "I'm going to prepare a strategy for this battle.
For now, I need you to capture that keep!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "I don't have the time to deal with these vermin!
There are preparations that need my attention!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "The enemy is attacking the Allied Base!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Wonderful!
Now take the East Field Keep!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "You must retake the Central Keep!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Magnificent!
Now take the Central Keep!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Retake the East Field Keep! Hurry!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "We have forced the invaders into the north!
Now we must call upon the Great Fairy!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "That wall is preventing us from entering...
If only we possessed an explosive weapon...",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Be on the alert! The enemy is attacking from
the north!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "So the scum finally broke through! Now! Move
south and swarm the Hyrulean base!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "This way! We must pray to the Great Fairy
together!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "You did it! The enemy's forces have suffered
a great loss!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "The enemy is running scared! We have an
opening!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Great! Now we can counterattack!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Please, Princess Zelda, you must pull back.
We can manage the battle from here.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "I understand. May the Goddeses protect you!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Isn't that touching? Well, I have something
more fun planned...",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Hiya ha ha! This is where it gets interesting!
Unleash King Dodongo!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "What sort of monster is this?",
  "1.0.41.0" => "L-let's do what we can to stop it!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "W-we have to stop it!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "D-don't give up! If the base falls, the
battle's lost!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Use this! It will increase the power of
your bombs!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Excellent job, everyone!
That's why we should never give up!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Commander Impa, terrible news!
The enemy wizard has seized castle!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "What? So the beast was just a distraction...
Where is Princess Zelda? Is she safe?",
  "1.0.48.0" => "The light shall return to Huryle...",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Have we truly been defeated...?",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Princess Zelda has fled... There's no way
we can continue now!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "Link, you can wipe them all out at once
with your Special Attack!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Hiya ha ha! Keep attacking!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "This is our chance! Attack!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Come! We strike as one!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Is Volga slacking off again?
Fine! Send out the next unit!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Destroy them! If you use Unleash Magic,
you'll become a fearsome warrior!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "If this plan works, we can greatly damage
our foes! Quickly, to the Fairy Fountain!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Quickly! Help me break open the gate!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Stop inching like snails, and move south!
Close in on the Hyrulean base!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "The Central Keep has been overrun!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "You sloths finally broke though? Good! Now
advance on the Hyrulean base already!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "What? The East Field Keep has been taken?",
  "1.0.63.0" => "What did you say?",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Impossible! The princess cannot be lost!
Why can no one locate her?",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Link, look! The princess!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "You! I saw you in the training yard!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Princess Zelda, are you hurt? This trainee
used some bombs to open the way!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "A trainee, huh? Well, from the smallest
seed comes the biggest tree, I suppose.",
  "1.0.69.0" => "A large boulder is blocking our advance.
Can you use your bombs to destroy it?",
  "1.0.70.0" => "We, uh...we can't find her anywhere!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "What?",
  "1.0.72.0" => "Leave the East Keep to us!
Someone take the central one!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "You must capture the Central Keep!
Meanwhile, I shall attack the Enemy Base!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "I refuse to leave Impa alone among the
enemy... I must rescue her!",
  "1.0.75.0" => "The Gorons are in trouble!
Stay safe until I arrive!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "Impa is unreachable with those boulders in the
way... I must find a way to destroy them!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "With this, I should be able to break the
boulders and reach Impa!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "Impa! Are you all right?",
  "1.0.79.0" => "Princess Zelda! Forgive me! Falling right into
their trap was a foolish thing for me to do...",
  "1.0.80.0" => "No apologies necessary. For now, we must
focus on a forward attack! Come!",
  "1.0.81.0" => "Princess Zelda, use this! It should up your
bombs' effectiveness!",
  "1.0.82.0" => "Princess Zelda...please forgive me...",
  "1.0.83.0" => "Capture the Central Keep! I will strike at the
Enemy Base while you do!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "If we use this to break those boulders,
we'll be able to reach Princess Zelda!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "Oh no! We have to protect the Stronghold!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "We've got to take back Central Keep!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "We have to retake the East Field Keep!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "Careful, everyone! There are enemies
approaching from the north!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "This is bad--the enemy is advancing through the
Central Keep!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "What do we do? The enemy is coming through
the East Keep!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "Princess Zelda! Leave the rest to us!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "Is that...a ghost or something?",
  "13.0.9.0" => "The Gorons are in trouble! 
C'mon, Link! Let's go!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "I can't reach Impa with those boulders in the
way... How could I destroy them...?",
  "13.0.11.0" => "With this, I could destroy those boulders and
reach Impa...",
  "13.0.12.0" => "Princess Zelda, use this! It should increase the
impact of your bombs!",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Princess Zelda... Please forgive me...",
  "13.0.14.0" => "You must capture the Central Keep!
I'll mount an attack on the Enemy Base!",
}